                   Default: ``logging.WARN``
       
               onnx (:class:`Optional[int]`):
                   The log level for the ONNX exporter component. Default: ``logging.WARN``
       
               bytecode (:class:`bool`):
                   Whether to emit the original and generated bytecode from TorchDynamo.
                   Default: ``False``
       
               aot_graphs (:class:`bool`):
